<p>Infuse yourself with the raging fury of the Sun, increasing your physical and spell critical chance by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2%, 4%, 6%, 8%, 10%.</acronym></p><p>Each time you crit with a physical attack or a spell you have <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">34%, 49%, 58%, 64%, 69%</acronym> chance to gain Sun's Vengeance for 2 turns.</p><p>While affected by Sun's Vengeance, your Sun Ray will take no time to use and will deal 25% more damage.</p><p>If Sun Ray was on cooldown, the remaining turns are reduced by one instead.</p><p>This effect can only happen once per turn.</p>